  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_UninstallDescription\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Agar Windows Mixed Reality yaxshi ishlamayotgan yoki siz diskdan joy bo‘shatmoqchi bo‘lsangiz, uni o‘chirib tashlash mumkin. Bunda foydalanuvchiga oid ma’lumotlar o‘chib ketib, Windows Mixed Reality sozlamalari asliga qaytariladi, biroq kompyuteringizga oldindan o‘rnatilgan aralash reallik ilovalari qoladi.

Windows Mixed Reality muhitidan yana foydalanish uchun Start > Aralash reallik portaliga kiring.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_UninstallDescription2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: If Windows Mixed Reality isn’t working well or if you want to free up disk space, uninstall and then install it again (go to Start and select Mixed Reality Portal). Your user info will be removed when uninstalling, but your mixed reality apps will remain on your PC.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_ClearDataDescription\Text:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Your device captures your environment to give you the best possible experience.

