    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Use speech recognition in Windows Mixed Reality including dictation and interacting with apps using voice commands. Speech recognition will always be listening when mixed reality is in use.

If your headset is in use and online speech recognition is enabled through other experiences, such as Cortana or Windows Dictation, we'll send everything you say to Microsoft's cloud-based speech recognition service. We use your voice data to help improve our speech services. If you don't want everything you say to be sent to Microsoft while your headset is in use, turn off the Speech recognition setting on this page before enabling online speech recognition.
